        "html": "<p>Quotient rule numerator: \\((y^2-y+1)-(y-1)(2y-1)=y^2-y+1-(2y^2-3y+1)=-y^2+2y\\).</p><p>\\(g'(y)=\\dfrac{-y(y-2)}{(y^2-y+1)^2}\\). The denominator is never 0 (its discriminant is negative).</p><p class=\"ans\">\\(y=0\\) and \\(y=2\\)</p>"
