        "label": "Step-by-step walkthrough",
        "html": "<div class=\"walk\"><p><strong>Step 1.</strong></p>\\[\\displaystyle y'=3x^2e^{2x}+x^3\\cdot2e^{2x}\\]<p><strong>Step 2.</strong> Factor.</p>\\[\\displaystyle =x^2e^{2x}(3+2x)\\]</div>"
